  "description": "Convert HTML + CSS to PDF in pure C# / .NET 10 — no browser engine, no Chromium, no subprocess at render time. Apache-2.0. A single dependency-light package with a one-line API (HtmlPdf.Convert). Native text-shaping and image deps (HarfBuzzSharp, SkiaSharp) are permissive-licensed and bundled via the official native-asset NuGets, with full Linux/Windows/macOS RID coverage.",
